(cell "III VEL" "N1" "VEL, or: the lamp lit where a or b is 1, or both.")
(cell "III VEL" "N2" "Given NON-ET, =1-x*y; NON, =1-x; and ET, proven at II, =x*y. Write y in J3.")
(cell "III VEL" "N3" "Chrysippus's dog, at a fork of three roads, sniffs two, finds no scent, and takes the third unsniffed.")
(cell "III VEL" "N4" "It reasoned in VEL: this road or that or the other, not this, not that, so the other.")
(cell "III VEL" "N7" "Space toggles the switch the selection stands on, 1 and 0 set it, a click toggles it; in the room 1 and 0 write themselves; T tests, R resets, N and P move.")
(cell "III VEL" "N10" "A switch or a lamp written over is lost until Load, which loads every level afresh: R writes values, never a formula.")
(formula "III VEL" "N8" "=\"Gates \"&Lab!E13&IF(Lab!Q13>0,\", \"&Lab!Q13&\" outside the set given, the first at \"&Lab!R13,\"\")&\"; the budget 4, the least known 3: \"&Lab!H13")
(formula "III VEL" "N9" "=IF(Lab!N13=1,\"Calculemus: input \"&Lab!$B$6+1&\" of 4\",IF(Lab!B13=2,\"The test stops at input \"&Lab!C13+1&\" of 4, standing on the board: \"&IF(Lab!S13<>\"\",Lab!S13&\" holds an error: it reads a text, an emptied cell or an error.\",IF(Lab!L13=0,\"a switch written over does not follow the test. Load restores it, and empties every level.\",\"a lamp differs from its due.\")),IF(Lab!S13<>\"\",Lab!S13&\" holds an error: it reads a text, an emptied cell or an error.\"&\" Ex nihilo nihil fit.\",IF(Lab!B13=1,\"Quod erat demonstrandum: every one of its 4 inputs passes.\",\"T tests every input, an input a frame. Calculemus!\"))))")
