(formula "V ELIGE" "N9" "=IF(Lab!N15=1,\"Calculemus: input \"&Lab!$B$6+1&\" of 8\",IF(Lab!B15=2,\"The test stops at input \"&Lab!C15+1&\" of 8, standing on the board: \"&IF(Lab!S15<>\"\",Lab!S15&\" holds an error: it reads a text, an emptied cell or an error.\",IF(Lab!L15=0,\"a switch written over does not follow the test. Load restores it, and empties every level.\",\"a lamp differs from its due.\")),IF(Lab!S15<>\"\",Lab!S15&\" holds an error: it reads a text, an emptied cell or an error.\"&\" Ex nihilo nihil fit.\",IF(Lab!B15=1,\"Quod erat demonstrandum: every one of its 8 inputs passes.\",\"T tests every input, an input a frame. Calculemus!\"))))")
