(formula "XI TENE" "M3" "=Lab!L51")
(cell "XI TENE" "N1" "TENE, hold: with load at 1, q' is d; with load at 0, q' is q, and q keeps its bit for as long as it likes.")
(cell "XI TENE" "N2" "Given every gate proven and ELIGE. A gate reads the flip-flop as it reads a switch: the loop runs through the clock, never around it.")
(cell "XI TENE" "N3" "Rem tene, verba sequentur, said Cato: hold the matter and the words will follow. Hold the bit, and the memory will.")
(cell "XI TENE" "N7" "Space toggles the switch the selection stands on, 1 and 0 set it, a click toggles it; in the room 1 and 0 write themselves; T tests, R resets, N and P move.")
(cell "XI TENE" "N10" "A switch or a lamp written over is lost until Load, which loads every level afresh: R writes values, never a formula.")
(formula "XI TENE" "N8" "=\"Gates \"&Lab!E21&IF(Lab!Q21>0,\", \"&Lab!Q21&\" outside the set given, the first at \"&Lab!R21,\"\")&\"; the budget 3, the least known 1: \"&Lab!H21")
(formula "XI TENE" "N9" "=IF(Lab!N21=1,\"Calculemus: input \"&Lab!$B$6+1&\" of 8\",IF(Lab!B21=2,\"The test stops at input \"&Lab!C21+1&\" of 8, standing on the board: \"&IF(Lab!S21<>\"\",Lab!S21&\" holds an error: it reads a text, an emptied cell or an error.\",IF(Lab!L21=0,\"a switch written over does not follow the test. Load restores it, and empties every level.\",\"a lamp differs from its due.\")),IF(Lab!S21<>\"\",Lab!S21&\" holds an error: it reads a text, an emptied cell or an error.\"&\" Ex nihilo nihil fit.\",IF(Lab!B21=1,\"Quod erat demonstrandum: every one of its 8 inputs passes.\",\"T tests every input, an input a frame. Calculemus!\"))))")
(formula "XI TENE" "N11" "=IF(Lab!$E$2<>11,\"C ticks the clock once. G clears the flip-flops and runs the clock until they stand still.\",IF(Lab!$E$3=1,\"Currit, it runs: tick \"&Lab!$E$4,IF(Lab!$E$9=1,\"Stat, it stands: its last move at tick \"&Lab!$E$4-1&\".\",IF(Lab!$E$9=2,\"In aeternum: 2 ticks, no rest. 1 flip-flop holds 2 states, so one came twice: it never halts. A short tape answers Turing.\",\"C ticks the clock once. G clears the flip-flops and runs the clock until they stand still.\"))))")
