(formula "XIII NUMERA" "N11" "=IF(Lab!$E$2<>13,\"C ticks the clock once. G clears the flip-flops and runs the clock until they stand still.\",IF(Lab!$E$3=1,\"Currit, it runs: tick \"&Lab!$E$4,IF(Lab!$E$9=1,\"Stat, it stands: its last move at tick \"&Lab!$E$4-1&\".\",IF(Lab!$E$9=2,\"In aeternum: 16 ticks, no rest. 4 flip-flops hold 16 states, so one came twice: it never halts. A short tape answers Turing.\",\"C ticks the clock once. G clears the flip-flops and runs the clock until they stand still.\"))))")
